# Goes in /mnt/user/appdata/github-runner/.env on the Unraid box.
# NEVER commit a filled-in copy of this file. Never send this token to
# Claude — create it directly in GitHub and paste it only here.
#
# Fine-grained PAT, scoped to the iggii-ai-stack repo ONLY, with:
#   Administration: Read and write
# (This is what lets the container mint its own runner-registration
# token each time it starts, so it survives restarts without you having
# to manually paste a fresh one-hour token every time.)
#
# This is intentionally a SEPARATE token from the one used for
# `git push` / Actions workflow permissions — different blast radius if
# either one ever leaks.
ACCESS_TOKEN=
